ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260606/202606060544575889_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260606/202606060544575889_720.jpg"> </div><p>【卡尔无缘世界杯】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a233cad048a8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：卡尔遭遇肌肉纤维撕裂无缘参加世界杯，将补招韦德拉奥果</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260606/202606060618227060.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260606/202606060618227060.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260606/202606060618227060.jpg"> </div><p>德足协官方消息，卡尔遭遇肌肉纤维撕裂，将无缘参加世界杯。德国队将补招莱比锡中场韦德拉奥果。</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a23044c610a1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">里克尔梅：哈兰德解约金低于1.8亿欧，如果我当选会签他，我保证</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/6960b1d491755.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/6960b1d491755.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260109/6960b1d491755.jpg"> </div><p>皇马主席候选人里克尔梅确认，如果他当选皇马主席，那么那会为皇马签下哈兰德。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a232f196a1f1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">里克尔梅：若我赢得选举将邀请克洛普执教，希望他引领新的时代</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250115/678767f3be042.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250115/678767f3be042.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250115/678767f3be042.jpg"> </div><p>皇马主席候选人里克尔梅发布公告，确认他们计划中选择的主帅是克洛普。他表示，如果他赢得选举，劳尔就将联系克洛普，介绍他们的皇马计划。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a2347672f5banative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打脸！克洛普经纪人回应里克尔梅：真让人恼火，克洛普不想执教</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.48" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a7ddf97e424.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.48" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.48" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a7ddf97e424.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260304/69a7ddf97e424.jpg"> </div><p>此前里克尔梅发布声明，称如果当选皇马主席，将邀请克洛普执教皇马。对此，德天空独家消息称，克洛普经纪人做出回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-05/6a22f0f3909d2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：拜仁正在探索签恩古莫哈可能性，利物浦视他为非卖品</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a231808b2aacnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德天空：拜仁签恩古莫哈因利物浦不卖而告吹 现已专注塞巴里+布朗</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.4" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250827/68aecd9ae6589.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.4" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.4" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250827/68aecd9ae6589.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250827/68aecd9ae6589.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic消息，拜仁正在探索签下恩古莫哈的可能性，他是拜仁左路引援首要目标，但利物浦明确不卖。后续德天空称，交易此前就已经告吹。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-05/6a22ef16abf92native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：老佛爷、穆帅都希望签维蒂尼亚和内维斯，但巴黎表态不卖</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a17f6934efb2.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a17f6934efb2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260528/6a17f6934efb2.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，弗洛伦蒂诺和穆里尼奥都非常欣赏巴黎中场维蒂尼亚和内维斯。但是巴黎明确表态，这两人都不会转会。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a22f3be498b7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">米体：朗尼克想挖圣徒总监和曼联首席球探，要求米兰下周前做决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251116/6919325d642aa.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251116/6919325d642aa.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251116/6919325d642aa.jpg"> </div><p>《米兰体育报》报道，朗尼克希望将南安普顿体育总监约翰内斯·斯波斯和曼联首席球探克里斯托弗·维维尔带到米兰。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-06/6a22f74eb4debnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">去年要价8000万！ESPN：萨维尼奥决心去热刺，曼城估价6000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; 